    "callouts": [
      {
        "type": "use-cases-and-examples",
        "title": "Untitled",
        "body": "**Complete Component Tagging Examples**\n\n**Example 1: Academic Research Persona**\n```yaml\ntags: [type/atomic, function/persona, domain/academic, complexity/advanced, \n       performance/proven, compatible/universal, usecase/analysis, \n       cognitive/evaluation, success/high-90, combines/well]\n```\n\n**Example 2: Technical Documentation Workflow**\n```yaml\ntags: [type/composite, function/workflow, domain/technical, complexity/intermediate,\n       performance/validated, platform/obsidian, tool/dataview, output/markdown,\n       strategy/chain-of-thought, project/internal, reliability/consistent]\n```\n\n**Example 3: Experimental Creative Format**\n```yaml\ntags: [type/specialized, function/format, domain/creative, complexity/expert,\n       performance/experimental, tested/pending, maintenance/active,\n       evolution/emerging, experiment/active, author/user]\n```",
        "line_number": 128,
        "source": "reference-taxonomy-prompt-library-tag-taxonomy-2025111106.md",
        "char_start": 12031,
        "char_end": 12969
      },
      {
        "type": "quick-reference",
        "title": "Untitled",
        "body": "**Tag Implementation Checklist**\n- 🔑 **Essential Tags**: Type, Function, Domain (mandatory for all components)\n- 🔑 **Quality Tags**: Performance, Testing, Reliability (add after validation)\n- 🔑 **Management Tags**: Project, Priority, Author (for organization)\n- 🔑 **Evolution Tags**: Version, Modified, Evolution (for lifecycle tracking)\n- 🔑 **Integration Tags**: Compatible, Platform, Tool (for technical requirements)",
        "line_number": 164,
        "source": "reference-taxonomy-prompt-library-tag-taxonomy-2025111106.md",
        "char_start": 14147,
        "char_end": 14600
      }
